# Butler Routes - Zephras Isle recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, designs and manuals whose SOURCE is on
# Zephras Isle, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item,
# vendor and drop tables). Everything here is vendor-sold; the drop scan over all
# 315 Zephras NPCs, all Zephras objects and both fixed chest placements found zero
# recipe items, and quest records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those.
# Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/zephras-isle-recipes
title Zephras Isle - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-12
zone Zephras Isle
faction Alliance
race Skyborne
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords zephras, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Valanaar (Nyalah Brightfire)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 257006 -- Nyalah Brightfire (60.6, 72.7), who also gives the core quest Crab Season
  buy 6325 "Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish"
  buy 6326 "Recipe: Slitherskin Mackerel"
  buy 6328 "Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — Shen'dar (Zerril Softbreeze)
  when skill Cooking 1

